dsh-elephant-goldfish packages the Elephant-Goldfish Model (EGM) for DeepSeek
Harness.

EGM content
-----------
The following files are copied from https://github.com/google/elephant-goldfish-model
(version 0.1.1) and remain Copyright 2026 Google LLC, licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0:

  skills/, agents/, resources/, LICENSE, icon.svg

Local changes to that content are limited to: the DeepSeek Harness pointer line
at the top of each skills/*/SKILL.md, the delegation sentence naming the
`subagent` tool, the link that used to point at docs/harnesses.md, the
invocation frontmatter of the four supporting skills (egm-resolve,
egm-review-loop, egm-bootstrap, egm-drift-report), the Claude/Codex command
forms rewritten to the DSH form (`/egm-<name>`), the `ask_question` tool name
rewritten to `ask_user_question`, one inline-scout clause at
egm-bootstrap Step 4 (a worker cannot delegate on DSH), and one "never spawn
egm-synthesizer" note at egm-brainstorm Step 2 (the same direct-dispatch rule
docs/dsh.md states). The review protocol, personas, and document standards are
otherwise unmodified.

Port code
---------
lib/index.js, cordis.patch.yml, package.json, docs/dsh.md, locale/, and
README.md are the DeepSeek Harness integration written for this package. They
are provided under the same Apache License, Version 2.0.

This is an unofficial port. The Elephant-Goldfish Model is not an officially
supported Google product, and neither is this bundle.
